# id: N1-P5a
# title: In the issue hour the boot's first social minute issues the week once, with no GM action
# needs: headless
# source: WORLD_SYSTEMS_PLAN.md N1 live check P5 (and "done when": a Sunday issue appears with no GM action)
# setup: start the stack on a Sunday (GMT) with -Reseed (the dump has no living_paper rows: changeset 64 makes the
#        table at boot); then restart it (stop-check-stack.ps1, start-check-stack.ps1 -SkipBuild, no -Reseed) and run
#        P5b-after-restart.check
wait 60
expectbootlog paper: week [0-9]+ issued
expectsql SELECT COUNT(*) FROM living_paper WHERE week_of = DATEDIFF(DATE_SUB(UTC_DATE(), INTERVAL WEEKDAY(UTC_DATE()) DAY), '1970-01-01') LIMIT 1 == 1 within 30
